## Interface: 16001
## Title: Guidelime |cff66ff66Forever Alliance 1-30|r
## Notes: Braedyn's Alliance levelling route for WoW Forever - Dwarf Shaman and Dwarf/Human Hunter, class and race steps filtered automatically. 1-20: Eastern Kingdoms, Hall of Thanes + Deadmines (24-25 Sep 2026, audited 17 Oct against QuestieDB Forever 1.0.6). 20-30 (18 Oct 2026): Ruins of Lordaeron, Loch Modan, Redridge, Darkshore, Ashenvale + Blackfathom Deeps, Duskwood, the Stockade, Wetlands, Darnassus, Excavation Site, Hillsbrad, Gnomeregan, Razorfen Kraul - every Alliance dungeon quest in the bracket, Call of Water and Call of Air for the shaman. 25 Oct: launch-crowd layer in 1-15, Call of Water finale moved to Westfall, shaman fixes, Dalaran lead-ins carried from 15/23. 27 Oct: cooking + fishing layer (Longjaw Mud Snapper and Mithril Head Trout food plan, Journeyman/Expert steps, fish-to-N stops, Seasoned Wolf Kabobs), drop-rate pass (Never Saddle on Quality retargeted to Elder Snow Leopards; Show of Force, The Quarry's Smith and Slowing the Orc Advance dropped; kill budgets and one-kill notes). 28 Oct: Cooking-175 steps (Hot Spices at Menethil, cook omelets to 175 at Whelgar) so the Mithril Head Trout opens at 29-30; [TAR] tags on the Minor Manifestation of Earth, Kernobee and Willix. 29 Oct: First Aid thread (bandage-to-N stops at 20/50/75/100/125; Heavy Linen 40 and Journeyman at Nissa Firestone, Wool 80 at Michelle Belle, Heavy Wool 115 at Fremal Doohickey, Expert book at Deneb Walker in Stromgarde on the Call of Air leg - recipe values from the Wowhead Forever spell pages). 1 Nov: Alba's Westfall chain reordered to its QuestieDB 1.0.9 prerequisites (The State of the Mines after the well and gill hand-ins, the Moonbrook crates and the Stormwind explosives chain on the Deadmines trip, one run), Harvesting the Harvesters item-start fixed, Blackrock Blockade made a plain step and handed in before Shadow Magic and Tharil'zun, Alther's Mill left to chapter 10, Holy Diver dropped (0 XP, needs all nine beached quests). Gear calls rescored on the 1 Nov tooltips: thirteen quoted stats corrected (Deepgrave Trousers, Ironforge Greathammer, Rockslicer, Flamefist Grips, Bravo's Armbands and others changed in the October builds); Frontier Britches and Smith's Trousers now replace Deepgrave, Staff of Westfall over the Greathammer when no Deadmines 2H drops, Boots of the People's Militia over statless boots, Garb of Florid Feathers over Raptorbane; roll-if-it-drops notes for Blackened Defias Leggings, Bloodied Chestwraps, Witherbite Bracers and the Electrocutioner Lagnut.
## Author: Braedyn (with Claude)
## Version: 2026.11.01
